{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>How many times would you relive the same day to save someone you love?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/c3e7f29fb331fccb5a813f1a1b09a918.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>GRIMSLAIR</strong> you step into the role of Adam, son of the Grim Reaper, drafted into the family business under a brutal deal: reap enough souls each day and Grim will keep listening to your plea to bring your girlfriend back to life. Miss the quota and the clock snaps back in time\u2014memories intact, deck refreshed, and stakes higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At your side is your <strong>ghost dog</strong>, a loyal partner with their own cards, synergies, and ways to get into (or save you from) trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat plays out in a tactical, <strong>turn-based battle mode built around a chain belt of cards</strong>. When you play each card matters: link attacks, blocks, and dog abilities into chains that power up, overlap, or break depending on their neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soulword-driven deckbuilding</strong> <br>Collect and fuse Soulwords that change how your cards behave: more damage, new targeting patterns, resource gains, status effects, and powerful tradeoffs. Evolve favorite cards across loops and experiment with builds that only work because you\u2019ve bent the deck into something uniquely yours.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/9abfe5de55d293765c63d3522e01b726.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/9abfe5de55d293765c63d3522e01b726.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/9abfe5de55d293765c63d3522e01b726.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain-based battle system</strong><br>Battles revolve around a five-slot chain belt where card order and adjacency matter. The cards Grim throws onto the belt can set up an easy round\u2014or a devastating onslaught\u2014if you don\u2019t have the tools to disrupt or manipulate his plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/474af4c8a8d929ec3c976311163229c9.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/474af4c8a8d929ec3c976311163229c9.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/474af4c8a8d929ec3c976311163229c9.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/03052fcfc1bbdb73c2b1fdfae92a97f4.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/03052fcfc1bbdb73c2b1fdfae92a97f4.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/03052fcfc1bbdb73c2b1fdfae92a97f4.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily soul quotas &amp; time loops</strong> <br>Every day starts with a fresh soul quota and a new chance to get it right. Track down enemies across the map, decide which fights are worth the risk, and feel the tension rise as the clock pushes you toward one last desperate battle before the day snaps back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adam &amp; his ghost dog</strong><br>You\u2019re never reaping alone. Your dog helps you overcome traps during exploration and fights beside you with their own cards, roles, and status effects. Protect each other, build decks around dog-focused support or aggression, and feel it when your partner gets stunned, wounded, or pulls off a clutch save.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in hostile biomes</strong><br>Navigate through graveyards, forests, caves, and unique locations that upgrade Adam. Shifting day/night cycles and dynamic weather change visibility, danger, and what you\u2019re willing to risk to overcome Grim\u2019s obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/45cd1c0633234330977c7c139eae4429.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/45cd1c0633234330977c7c139eae4429.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/45cd1c0633234330977c7c139eae4429.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that echo between loops</strong><br>Comfort or abandon lost souls, hoard or sacrifice rare rewards, appease Grim or push back against him. Notes, encounters, and consequences carry across runs, slowly revealing why you ended up in Grimslair\u2014and what it might cost to finally change the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0c09578752844cc70b933ef6db7e7699.poster.avif?t=1768812957\" width=608 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0c09578752844cc70b933ef6db7e7699.webm?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/extras/0c09578752844cc70b933ef6db7e7699.mp4?t=1768812957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO BECOME THE NEXT GRIM REAPER? The choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content notice:</strong> themes of death, grief, mild horror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799560?t=1768812957","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/0b1060907dcf111e635292237eebf53eef583914/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768812957","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799560/779f34c21d9dae89f6eac397bf1c6907c23c3a7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t